<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2605] Import Notebook has 1MB limit but there is no error when save large size Notebook</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2605</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1.Save/Download a notebook that is larger than 1MB,  there is no warning/error.&lt;br/&gt;
2. When import the saved notebook, there is 1MB limitation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Suggestion: Saving a notebook that is larger than 1MB should show warning/error messages. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
